<p>You make a first attack with your mainhand for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">151%, 164%, 174%, 182%, 190%</acronym> weapon damage.</p><p>If the attack hits the target is distracted and you use that to violently slam your mindstar into it, dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">439%, 476%, 504%, 528%, 550%</acronym> damage.</p><p>The shock is so powerful the target is stunned for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 7, 9, 10, 11</acronym> turns and all creatures around in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym> are dazed for the same time.</p><p>The stun and daze duration is dependant on the number of psionic disruption charges on the target, the given number is for 4 charges.</p><p>If you do not have a one handed weapon and a mindstar equiped, but have them in your off set, you instantly automatically switch. The wild psionic powers are incompatible with the focused nature of psiblades.</p>